# Allowlist for the release branch: ignore everything by default, then un-ignore only
# what a user of the script needs on GitHub. Dev source, dev builds, build tooling and
# notes stay local, even though they sit in the same folder as on DevBranch.

/*

# Repo config
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Release build and its update-check file
!/BigBlackGymLog.js
!/BigBlackGymLog.meta.js

# Docs the script loads at runtime
!/UserDocs/

# Images the script loads at runtime
!/ScrptImgs/
